        "username": "The_Blue-Eyed_Bard",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/the_blue-eyed_bard/{size}/2153_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-12-06T22:39:57.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Nilus\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/nilus/48/2099_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Nilus:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div><b>The Blue-Eyed Bard wrote:</b><br><blockquote>So, in discussing 'Trust Fund', am I the only one that laughed out loud when Christopher mentioned Mister Fixer looking in on the party through a window.....?\"Slim, what're you doing?\"\"...guessing? I...guess there's something going on in there?\"\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\nIts either a reference too or a similar joke to one in Robin Hood: Men in Tights. &nbsp;&nbsp;\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>The reference was my own. It was the first thing that came to mind when Christopher said that.</p>",
